#: kstart.cpp:172
msgid "Command to execute."
msgstr "Le^.nh se~ thu+.c hie^.n ."

#: kstart.cpp:174
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title.\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken. Not recommended!"
msgstr ""
"Mo^.t regular expression kho+'p vo+'i tie^u dde^` cu+?a so^? .\n"
"Ne^'u ba.n kho^ng muo^'n chi? ddi.nh ca'i na`y, thi` nhu+~ng cu+?a so^? xua^'t \n"
"hie^.n va`o lu'c dda^`u tie^n se~ bi. la^'y ddi ! Kho^ng khuye^'n nghi. !"

#: kstart.cpp:177
msgid "Desktop where to make the window appear. "
msgstr "Desktop no+i ma` cu+?a so^? se~ hie^.n ."

#: kstart.cpp:178
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application. "
msgstr ""
"La`m cho cu+?a so^? se~ hie^.n ra trong desktop ddu+o+.c ki'ch hoa.t \n"
"khi chu+o+ng tri`nh ddu+o+.c kho+?i ddo^.ng ."

#: kstart.cpp:179
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "La`m cho cu+?a so^? xua^'t hie^.n tre^n mo.i cu+?a so^? "

#: kstart.cpp:180
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "Icon hoa' cu+?a so^?"

#: kstart.cpp:181
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "Cu+.c dda.i cu+?a so^?"

#: kstart.cpp:182
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog or Override"
msgstr ""
"Kie^?u cu+?a so^? : Thu+o+`ng, Desktop, Dock, Co^ng cu., \n"
"Thu+.c ddno+, Tho^ng ddie^.p va `Override "

#: kstart.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"Nha?y to+'i cu+?a so^? cho  du` ne^'u no' ddu+o+.c kho+?i ddo^.ng \n"
"tu+` mo^.t deskop a?o kha'c "

#: kstart.cpp:185
msgid "Make the window always stay on top of any other window"
msgstr "La`m cho cu+?a so^? luo^n no^?i tre^n ba^'t ki` cu+?a so^? na`o kha'c "

#: kstart.cpp:186
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "Cu+?a so^? kho^ng la^'y ddu+o+.c ha.ng mu.c trong thanh ta'c vu. "

#: kstart.cpp:187
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "Cu+?a so^? kho^ng la^'y ddu+o+.c ha.ng mu.c tre^n pager"

#: kstart.cpp:188
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker."
msgstr "Cu+?a so^? ddu+o+.c gu+?i to+'i khay he^. tho^'ng trong Kicker ."

#: kstart.cpp:195
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "KStart"

#: kstart.cpp:196
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special "
"decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"Tie^.n i'ch dde^? kho+?i ddo^.ng chu+o+ng tri`nh vo+'i mo^.t ti'nh cha^'t cu+?a\n"
"so^? dda(.c bie^.t nhu+ icon hoa', cu+.c dda.i hoa', deskop a?o na`o ddo',"
"bo^' tri' dda(.c bie^.t \n"
" vv ..."

#: kstart.cpp:216
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "Kho^ng co' le^.nh ddu+o+.c chi? ddi.nh "

